# Thresher environment template. Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
# Nothing is required for M0 (pure engine). All keys below arrive at M1+.

# Upstash Redis (cache + rate limiting) — M1
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# Supabase — M2
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Clerk (auth) — M2. Present => auth ON; absent => app runs open (dev/CI).
# Local dev uses the Clerk DEVELOPMENT instance keys (pk_test_/sk_test_);
# Cloudflare uses the PRODUCTION instance keys (pk_live_/sk_live_).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_IN_URL=/sign-in
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_UP_URL=/sign-up
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_IN_FALLBACK_REDIRECT_URL=/app
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_UP_FALLBACK_REDIRECT_URL=/app

# logo.dev (company / brokerage logos) — optional. Absent => monogram badges.
# Free publishable token (pk_...) from https://logo.dev. Attribution required on
# the free tier (a "Logos by Logo.dev" link is rendered in the footer).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOGO_DEV_TOKEN=

# Scan cron — shared secret gating /api/cron/scan (the scheduled board refresh).
# Set the SAME random value as a Cloudflare RUNTIME var and a GitHub Actions
# secret (see MANUAL.md). Absent => the cron endpoint is disabled (503).
# CRON_SECRET=

# (monitoring deferred — see MANUAL.md)

